  hints:[B('The three values sum to 9, so their mean is 3.','三個值總和為 9，所以平均數為 3。'),B('Subtract 3 from each value: −2,0,2. Their squares are 4,0,4.','每個值減 3，得 −2、0、2；平方為 4、0、4。'),B('Add the squares to get 8, then divide by 3 observations, following the n-denominator definition.','平方相加得 8，再按以 n 作分母的定義除以 3 個觀察值。')]
